    "details": "<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"c094c53c-bb05-4f90-877f-4d0cd91ae83f\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-6\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling\">\n<h1 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"1a9x3e2\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"26\">Qiskit Fall Fest @MPSTME</h1>\n<p data-start=\"28\" data-end=\"275\"><strong data-start=\"28\" data-end=\"56\">Qiskit Fall Fest @MPSTME</strong>, hosted by the <strong data-start=\"72\" data-end=\"159\">Mukesh Patel School of Technology Management and Engineering (MPSTME), NMIMS Mumbai</strong>, brings together students and quantum computing enthusiasts to explore, learn, and build with quantum technologies.</p>\n<p data-start=\"277\" data-end=\"540\">Organised in association with <strong data-start=\"307\" data-end=\"322\">IBM Quantum</strong>, Qiskit Fall Fest @MPSTME is designed to introduce participants to the rapidly evolving world of quantum computing while giving them the opportunity to apply their knowledge to practical problems and innovative ideas.</p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1i27knx\" data-start=\"542\" data-end=\"560\">About the Event</h2>\n<p data-start=\"562\" data-end=\"808\">Quantum computing is no longer limited to theoretical physics and research papers. With frameworks such as <strong data-start=\"669\" data-end=\"679\">Qiskit</strong>, developers and researchers can experiment with quantum circuits, algorithms, simulations, and hybrid quantum-classical systems.</p>\n<p data-start=\"810\" data-end=\"927\">At Qiskit Fall Fest @MPSTME, participants will explore different areas of the quantum computing ecosystem, including:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"929\" data-end=\"1190\">\n<li data-section-id=\"m2w9fv\" data-start=\"929\" data-end=\"961\">Quantum Computing Fundamentals</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"i76377\" data-start=\"962\" data-end=\"982\">Quantum Algorithms</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"ejruj3\" data-start=\"983\" data-end=\"1015\">Quantum Machine Learning (QML)</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1xnk8lc\" data-start=\"1016\" data-end=\"1048\">Quantum Neural Networks (QNNs)</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"110fpfr\" data-start=\"1049\" data-end=\"1071\">Quantum Optimisation</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"5124u4\" data-start=\"1072\" data-end=\"1092\">Quantum Simulation</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"140yrsn\" data-start=\"1093\" data-end=\"1129\">Hybrid Quantum-Classical Computing</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1j4960m\" data-start=\"1130\" data-end=\"1190\">Applications of Quantum Computing across different domains</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1192\" data-end=\"1336\">The event is open to individuals interested in exploring how quantum technologies can be applied to solve real-world and computational problems.</p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1on0pdd\" data-start=\"1338\" data-end=\"1383\">Learning &amp; Keynote Sessions &mdash; 24th October</h2>\n<p data-start=\"1385\" data-end=\"1552\">The event will include dedicated <strong data-start=\"1418\" data-end=\"1452\">teaching and learning sessions</strong>, helping participants understand the fundamentals of quantum computing and get started with Qiskit.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1554\" data-end=\"1776\">Participants will also have the opportunity to attend <strong data-start=\"1608\" data-end=\"1645\">keynote sessions by professionals</strong>, offering insights into the quantum computing industry, current developments, research, applications, and the future of the field.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1778\" data-end=\"1946\">Whether you're new to quantum computing or already exploring the field, these sessions will help participants build the foundation required to take their ideas further.</p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1w7c9tx\" data-start=\"1948\" data-end=\"1972\">Competition Structure</h2>\n<p data-start=\"1974\" data-end=\"2097\">Due to the overwhelming response to Qiskit Fall Fest @MPSTME, the competition will be conducted in <strong data-start=\"2073\" data-end=\"2096\">two separate stages</strong>.</p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"z7k2kk\" data-start=\"2099\" data-end=\"2145\">Stage 1: Project &amp; Presentation Submission</h3>\n<p data-start=\"2147\" data-end=\"2180\"><strong data-start=\"2147\" data-end=\"2180\">Topic Reveal &mdash; 12th September</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"2182\" data-end=\"2260\">The official competition topics/tracks will be revealed on <strong data-start=\"2241\" data-end=\"2259\">12th September</strong>.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2262\" data-end=\"2347\">Participants will then have a dedicated period to develop and prepare their projects.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2349\" data-end=\"2387\"><strong data-start=\"2349\" data-end=\"2387\">Submission Deadline &mdash; 12th October</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"2389\" data-end=\"2451\">All Stage 1 submissions must be completed by <strong data-start=\"2434\" data-end=\"2450\">12th October</strong>.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2453\" data-end=\"2525\">A <strong data-start=\"2455\" data-end=\"2495\">GitHub repository will be compulsory</strong> for every project submission.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2527\" data-end=\"2677\">Projects submitted during Stage 1 will undergo evaluation, following which selected teams/projects will progress to the next stage of the competition.</p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"p8g0d8\" data-start=\"2679\" data-end=\"2725\">Finalists Announcement &mdash; 17th&ndash;18th October</h3>\n<p data-start=\"2727\" data-end=\"2824\">The finalists for the second stage of the competition will be announced by <strong data-start=\"2802\" data-end=\"2823\">17th&ndash;18th October</strong>.</p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"z3682f\" data-start=\"2826\" data-end=\"2868\">Stage 2: Hybrid Judging &mdash; 25th October</h3>\n<p data-start=\"2870\" data-end=\"2998\">The second stage will consist of a <strong data-start=\"2905\" data-end=\"2947\">hybrid judging session on 25th October</strong>, combining both <strong data-start=\"2964\" data-end=\"2997\">online and offline evaluation</strong>.</p>\n<p data-start=\"3000\" data-end=\"3108\">Finalists will have the opportunity to present and demonstrate their work as part of the evaluation process.</p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"19f1juq\" data-start=\"3110\" data-end=\"3119\">Prizes</h2>\n<p data-start=\"3121\" data-end=\"3184\">The best projects will be recognised with the following prizes:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"3186\" data-end=\"3279\">\n<li data-section-id=\"vqcrv\" data-start=\"3186\" data-end=\"3217\"><strong data-start=\"3188\" data-end=\"3217\">1st Place &mdash; up to ₹10,000</strong></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"afng29\" data-start=\"3218\" data-end=\"3248\"><strong data-start=\"3220\" data-end=\"3248\">2nd Place &mdash; up to ₹5,000</strong></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"11qmf56\" data-start=\"3249\" data-end=\"3279\"><strong data-start=\"3251\" data-end=\"3279\">3rd Place &mdash; up to ₹3,000</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"3281\" data-end=\"3349\">The prize pool is subject to change based on the final event budget.</p>\n<p data-start=\"3638\" data-end=\"3925\">Whether you're interested in <strong data-start=\"3667\" data-end=\"3797\">quantum algorithms, QML, QNNs, quantum simulation, optimisation, or simply want to take your first step into quantum computing</strong>, Qiskit Fall Fest @MPSTME is your opportunity to learn, experiment, build, and explore the possibilities of quantum technology.</p>\n<p data-start=\"3927\" data-end=\"3996\">For more information and regular updates, visit our official website:</p>\n<p data-start=\"3998\" data-end=\"4035\"><span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"3998\" data-content-reference-end=\"4060\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"><a class=\"decorated-link\" href=\"https://qiskitfallfestmpstme.in/?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">qiskitfallfestmpstme.in</a></span></span></p>\n<p data-start=\"4037\" data-end=\"4089\">Also follow our official Instagram page for updates:</p>\n<p data-start=\"4091\" data-end=\"4128\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"4116\" data-content-reference-end=\"4180\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"><a class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">@qiskitff.mpstme</a></span></span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none -mb-px h-px w-full opacity-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
